## The scope pattern

Group the main actions in a scope named Try. Add a second scope named Catch that runs only when Try fails or times out.

## What to record

| Field | Why it matters |
| --- | --- |
| Flow name | Find the failing flow quickly |
| Run URL | Jump straight to the run history |
| Error message | Diagnose without reopening the run |
